## 🔗 Useful Commands

```bash
# Setup development environment
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
python -m pytest -q

# Run with coverage
python -m pytest --cov=src --cov-report=html

# Type checking
python -m mypy src/

# Linting
python -m pylint src/

# Security scan
bandit -r src/
pip-audit

# Format code
black src/ tests/
isort src/ tests/

# All checks before PR
python -m pytest -q && python -m pylint src/ && bandit -r src/
```

